      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "A bunch of friends joined a map at the same time the other night and holy hell the game slowed to a crawl.\nIt's not consistent though, seems to happen specifically in worlds with a lot of pickups, probably a syncing issue",
      "viewerReactions": null
