      "value": "Thank you for your report! We've made continuous performance improvements to VRChat, which should make lag spikes less likely to occur.\n\nIf you encounter issues like this, please provide a world or avatar ID and create a new post or support ticket.\n\nSome worlds or avatars have as optimization issues, which we could look into (see @{5baf2b2de038c00e28fd16b5|full_name}'t comment)",
